        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Astrohaulers</strong></i> is a sci-fi package management game that challenges you to build and expand your delivery network across the galaxy. Your mission is to deliver color-coded packages to the correct space stations. As you successfully deliver packages, you’ll unlock new stations and boost your score. Strategize your routes and optimize your deliveries to become the ultimate interstellar hauler!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590970/extras/41a3ff9adff36ec4b192488f537022f7.poster.avif?t=1783637050\" width=892 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590970/extras/41a3ff9adff36ec4b192488f537022f7.webm?t=1783637050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590970/extras/41a3ff9adff36ec4b192488f537022f7.mp4?t=1783637050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DELIVER PACKAGES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are in charge of coordinating deliveries across different sectors of space. Place packages on ships and send them to their destinations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590970/extras/3f5b350593bdcef418c60aa612633663.poster.avif?t=1783637050\" width=892 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590970/extras/3f5b350593bdcef418c60aa612633663.webm?t=1783637050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590970/extras/3f5b350593bdcef418c60aa612633663.mp4?t=1783637050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STRATEGIZE YOUR ROUTES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support efficient deliveries everywhere in your sector by strategically connecting stations. Be wary though, as routes can’t cross each other. Will you better connect important stations or will you be sure packages can get anywhere in your network in reasonable times?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590970/extras/214e828069533b9b478d78032077d641.poster.avif?t=1783637050\" width=892 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590970/extras/214e828069533b9b478d78032077d641.webm?t=1783637050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590970/extras/214e828069533b9b478d78032077d641.mp4?t=1783637050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ACHIEVE HIGH SCORES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each sector has its own challenges for you to master. Can you beat your high score? Can you beat ours?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590970/extras/63d36d9c9160490bf81cfe980b364514.poster.avif?t=1783637050\" width=892 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590970/extras/63d36d9c9160490bf81cfe980b364514.webm?t=1783637050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590970/extras/63d36d9c9160490bf81cfe980b364514.mp4?t=1783637050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>… OR WATCH YOUR NETWORK DESCEND INTO CHAOS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590970/extras/1d5d79ebc21b8f2d17ac5dc22dab0ce1.poster.avif?t=1783637050\" width=892 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590970/extras/1d5d79ebc21b8f2d17ac5dc22dab0ce1.webm?t=1783637050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590970/extras/1d5d79ebc21b8f2d17ac5dc22dab0ce1.mp4?t=1783637050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Astrohaulers</strong></i> is a sci-fi package management game that challenges you to build and expand your delivery network across the galaxy. Your mission is to deliver color-coded packages to the correct space stations. As you successfully deliver packages, you’ll unlock new stations and boost your score. Strategize your routes and optimize your deliveries to become the ultimate interstellar hauler!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590970/extras/41a3ff9adff36ec4b192488f537022f7.poster.avif?t=1783637050\" width=892 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590970/extras/41a3ff9adff36ec4b192488f537022f7.webm?t=1783637050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590970/extras/41a3ff9adff36ec4b192488f537022f7.mp4?t=1783637050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DELIVER PACKAGES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are in charge of coordinating deliveries across different sectors of space. Place packages on ships and send them to their destinations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590970/extras/3f5b350593bdcef418c60aa612633663.poster.avif?t=1783637050\" width=892 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590970/extras/3f5b350593bdcef418c60aa612633663.webm?t=1783637050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590970/extras/3f5b350593bdcef418c60aa612633663.mp4?t=1783637050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STRATEGIZE YOUR ROUTES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support efficient deliveries everywhere in your sector by strategically connecting stations. Be wary though, as routes can’t cross each other. Will you better connect important stations or will you be sure packages can get anywhere in your network in reasonable times?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590970/extras/214e828069533b9b478d78032077d641.poster.avif?t=1783637050\" width=892 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590970/extras/214e828069533b9b478d78032077d641.webm?t=1783637050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590970/extras/214e828069533b9b478d78032077d641.mp4?t=1783637050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ACHIEVE HIGH SCORES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each sector has its own challenges for you to master. Can you beat your high score? Can you beat ours?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590970/extras/63d36d9c9160490bf81cfe980b364514.poster.avif?t=1783637050\" width=892 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590970/extras/63d36d9c9160490bf81cfe980b364514.webm?t=1783637050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590970/extras/63d36d9c9160490bf81cfe980b364514.mp4?t=1783637050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>… OR WATCH YOUR NETWORK DESCEND INTO CHAOS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590970/extras/1d5d79ebc21b8f2d17ac5dc22dab0ce1.poster.avif?t=1783637050\" width=892 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590970/extras/1d5d79ebc21b8f2d17ac5dc22dab0ce1.webm?t=1783637050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590970/extras/1d5d79ebc21b8f2d17ac5dc22dab0ce1.mp4?t=1783637050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
